---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="DealyVIP Privacy Policy and Data Handling." lang="en">
  <div class="container section" style="max-width: var(--content-width);">
    <h1 class="display-title">Privacy & Data Handling</h1>
    
    <h2 class="section-title">Current Data Model</h2>
    <p class="mb-2">DealyVIP operates strictly as an informational and coordination layer. We do not maintain a complex backend database of user profiles.</p>
    <ul class="mb-4" style="padding-left: 1.5rem;">
      <li class="mb-1">We do not implement user accounts or client portals.</li>
      <li class="mb-1">We do not process or store payment information on this domain.</li>
      <li class="mb-1">We do not store your communication in an automated CRM (Customer Relationship Management) system.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="section-title">Communication Privacy</h2>
    <p class="mb-2">If you contact us via direct email or external messaging platforms (such as WhatsApp), your data is handled according to standard email and communication protocols.</p>
    <ul class="mb-4" style="padding-left: 1.5rem;">
      <li class="mb-1"><strong>No Automatic Analytics Processing:</strong> We do not algorithmically process your messages for marketing.</li>
      <li class="mb-1"><strong>Security Limitations:</strong> Standard email and third-party messaging apps are not secure channels for sensitive financial data. Do not send unredacted bank passwords, personal identity documents, or secure commercial secrets during initial contact.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="section-title">Analytics and Cookies</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">This website is built statically. We aim for a zero-JS default where possible and do not aggressively track users across the web.</p>
    
    <p class="text-muted" style="margin-top: var(--space-lg); font-size: 0.9rem;">Effective Date: May 2024. This policy reflects actual technical implementation, not boilerplate legal padding.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
